<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Tip Top Ice Cream to buy range of products.</title>
<headline>NZ's Tip Top Ice Cream to buy range of products.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tip Top Ice Cream Company Ltd said on Wednesday it had a conditional agreement to buy United Dairy Foods' novelty range, family pack and scoop ice cream business.</p>
<p>Tip Top recently receive Commerce Commission approval for the purchase.</p>
<p>United is a manufacturer and marketer of icecream and frozen confectionery, based in Otahuhu. It will continue to market and sell its principal brand, the New American range.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
